<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us. I regret we were unable to serve you a meal on board your recent flight QF{!Case.Flight_Number__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If moved to an earlier flight use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">When customers move to an earlier flight at the last minute, our caterers will always try to provide an additional meal to the aircraft prior to departure. However, it isn’t always possible in the short time frame.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If upgraded use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">When customers upgrade to Business Class on departure, our caterers will always try to get a new meal to the aircraft prior to your departure, but it isn’t always possible in the short time frame.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If moved by staff add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">In these instances, our staff will advise customers that the flight is ‘catering not assured’ prior to upgrading, so that they can decide if they are happy to risk flying without a meal.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If moved via kiosk add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">If changing flights via the check-in kiosk, as you did, we display information on the screen underneath the ‘Alternative flights’ options, before customers confirm their selection and elect to continue with the change.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I understand your confusion, if you missed this information and am sorry our crew did not handle this as well as we would have expected. Our staff should always be helpful and courteous, so I have forwarded your comments to our Cabin Crew Management to take up with the staff member directly.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We appreciate you taking the time to follow this up and have passed your comments to our catering management for future reviews of their processes. I hope we have the opportunity to welcome you aboard Qantas again soon.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><div style=""><font size="2"><br></font></div><font size="2"><br></font><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: white;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>